  "body": "Brand new and ready to impress, Lots 1 & 2 at 11 Serrata Place offer a great opportunity to secure a freehold standalone home in a convenient North Shore location.\r\n\r\nDesigned with space and practicality in mind, these homes offer comfortable modern living across two levels.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, providing a comfortable space for everyday living and entertaining. A separate guest toilet and an internal-access single garage with dedicated laundry space complete this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four double bedrooms provide plenty of room for families. The master bedroom comes with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while a separate family bathroom services the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nProperty features:\r\n- Brand new, freehold standalone home\r\n- Four double bedrooms\r\n- Two bathrooms, including master ensuite, plus a separate guest toilet\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Single internal-access garage\r\n- Double glazing and quality insulation\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet cul-de-sac, the property is conveniently located close to Browns Bay Village, local beaches, cafés and schools, and is zoned for Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a new family home or a low-maintenance property in a popular North Shore suburb, this is an opportunity worth considering.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
